# Real life is the game. Your phone is just the scoreboard. 🔥

**Macher** turns any event — a festival, a house party, a road trip, a random
Tuesday night out — into a points-scoring game of dares with your crew. Pull off a
challenge, prove it on camera, and watch your name climb the board. Try to fake
it? Your crew drags you to the tribunal.

**Coming soon to the App Store.**

---

## How it works

1. **Get a dare.** Take on an official challenge or one your crew dreamed up.
2. **Do it. Prove it.** Capture a photo or video on the spot, right in the app.
3. **Climb the board.** Points hit your crew's leaderboard the instant you tap.
4. **Keep it honest.** Smell a fake? The crew votes. Bogus proof loses its points.

---

## What's inside

🎯 **Dares & challenges** — Official ones, or savage ones your crew invents.

📸 **Proof or it didn't happen** — Captured in-app, on the spot. No camera-roll
uploads, no "trust me."

👯 **Crews** — Start one or join with a 6-letter code. One shared leaderboard, live
reactions, and a comment section built for trash talk.

⚖️ **The Tribunal** — Contest a dodgy proof and the crew votes it out. No refs, no
admins — just your friends and zero mercy.

🌍 **World events** — A global wall, rankings against every crew on the planet, and
a fresh featured dare every day. The XP you bank stays on your profile forever.

🎞️ **Your Wrapped** — Every event ends with a shareable recap: your XP, your rank,
your defining moment.

📡 **Works on one bar** — Points land even with zero signal. Your proof uploads
itself when the network's back. Built for festival fields and dead zones.

🔒 **Fun, but fair** — You decide who sees each proof. Block anyone. Report anything
over the line — reviewed and gone within 24 hours. Sign in with Apple keeps your
email hidden. No ads, no trackers, nothing sold. For ages 16+.

